# =====================================================================
# Release V133 -- Billing.Profile_Pricing date-ranged columns to PROD
# =====================================================================
# PROD still had the LEGACY Billing.Profile_Pricing (Year_Month only) -- the date-ranged
# Valid_From/Valid_To columns (commit ad13618) were only ever folded into the Table.sql file and
# relied on re-running V101, which is already marked applied on prod so the ALTER never ran there.
# Result: the Subscriptions form 500s ("Invalid column name 'Valid_From'" -> "Could not load the
# team"). This re-runs the idempotent table script (adds the two columns + backfills Valid_From from
# Year_Month) and reseeds the date-ranged prices. Idempotent; safe to re-apply.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V133__billing_pricing_date_ranged.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Billing.Profile_Pricing.Table.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Billing.Profile_Pricing.Data.sql

TEST
